First check: status of BCT
SELECT filename, status FROM v$block_change_tracking;

Possible statuses include ENABLED and DISABLED


Enable Block Change Tracking:

ALTER DATABASE ENABLE BLOCK CHANGE TRACKING USING FILE '/u01/app/oracle/block_change_tracking.bct';


Disable BCT:

ALTER DATABASE DISABLE BLOCK CHANGE TRACKING;

RAC / ASM Example:
ALTER DATABASE ENABLE BLOCK CHANGE TRACKING
USING FILE '+DATA';
